2
ROLE: Admin
MODULE: Schedule & Routes
CRUD ERROR: Validation / Conflict Checks
PROBLEM: Schedule validation and conflict checks compared dates using server UTC timezone (Carbon::today()) instead of local Manila timezone (Asia/Manila), causing conflicting schedule checks to be bypassed around midnight due to a 1-day date mismatch.
FIX: Replaced the Carbon::today() fallbacks with Carbon::now('Asia/Manila') in BusinessLogicService::checkScheduleConflict(), ScheduleConflictService::parseScheduleDateTime(), and ScheduleConflictService::scheduleStartDateTime(). Added dynamic projection of departure time onto existing schedule dates for rest period validations when only time is passed.

