MODULE: Driver Performance
CRUD ERROR: Read / Filtering
PROBLEM: The driver list status filter failed to match any results because the request filter values (active, inactive) were compared against the UI status values (On duty, Off duty), resulting in an empty list when filtered.
FIX: Mapped request status filter values (active, inactive, suspended) to corresponding UI status values (on duty, off duty, suspended) before performing the comparison inside DriverPerformanceController::getFilteredDriversList().

